<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1840835964"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:02.000"><div begin="24.413" end="56.581" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="24.413" end="28.535" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.413" end="25.454">夜晚</span><span begin="25.454" end="26.135">不</span><span begin="26.135" end="26.490">再</span><span begin="26.490" end="27.215">那</span><span begin="27.215" end="27.526">么</span><span begin="27.526" end="28.535">空</span></p><p begin="30.918" end="35.545" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.918" end="31.711">遇见你</span><span begin="31.711" end="32.547">后</span><span begin="32.547" end="32.865">每</span><span begin="32.865" end="33.586">天</span><span begin="33.586" end="34.018">都</span><span begin="34.018" end="35.016">睡好</span><span begin="35.016" end="35.545">久</span></p><p begin="36.077" end="39.384" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.077" end="36.348">闹</span><span begin="36.348" end="36.882">钟</span><span begin="36.882" end="37.168">也</span><span begin="37.168" end="37.895">懂</span><span begin="37.895" end="38.274">温</span><span begin="38.274" end="39.384">柔</span></p><p begin="41.554" end="45.652" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.554" end="42.482">那片星</span><span begin="42.482" end="43.224">空</span><span begin="43.224" end="43.587">在</span><span begin="43.587" end="44.280">你</span><span begin="44.280" end="44.655">眼</span><span begin="44.655" end="45.652">睛</span></p><p begin="48.069" end="52.711" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.069" end="48.931">偶尔看</span><span begin="48.931" end="49.715">见</span><span begin="49.715" end="49.986">流</span><span begin="49.986" end="50.770">星</span><span begin="50.770" end="51.113">变</span><span begin="51.113" end="52.066">你泪</span><span begin="52.066" end="52.711">滴</span></p><p begin="53.150" end="56.581" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.150" end="54.740">生命有彼此的</span><span begin="54.740" end="55.236">庆</span><span begin="55.236"